TECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS

Performance Requirements:
- Risk prediction processing time: <30 seconds for comprehensive analysis
- Early warning alert latency: <2 minutes from risk threshold breach
- Data integration frequency: Real-time for critical sources, hourly for others
- Prediction accuracy: >85% for high-risk events, >70% for medium-risk events
- System availability: 99.9% uptime with redundant processing capabilities

Machine Learning Specifications:
- Training data requirements: 5+ years of operational and compliance history
- Model architecture: Ensemble combining gradient boosting, neural networks, time series models
- Feature engineering: 500+ risk factors across operational, regulatory, environmental domains
- Retraining frequency: Weekly for short-term models, monthly for long-term models
- Prediction horizons: 7-day, 30-day, 90-day risk forecasts

Scalability and Integration:
- Organization capacity: 1000+ concurrent organizations
- Data processing throughput: 100GB+ daily data ingestion and analysis
- Alert processing capacity: 10,000+ risk assessments per hour
- API integration: REST APIs for third-party system integration
- Cloud deployment: Multi-region availability with auto-scaling capabilities

